  "bug": {
    "bug_id": "Cli-32",
    "project": "Cli",
    "summary": "StringIndexOutOfBoundsException in HelpFormatter.findWrapPos",
    "description": "In the last while loop in HelpFormatter.findWrapPos, it can pass text.length() to text.charAt(int), which throws a StringIndexOutOfBoundsException. The first expression in that while loop condition should use a <, not a <=.\n\nThis is on line 908 in r779646:\n\nhttp://svn.apache.org/viewvc/commons/proper/cli/trunk/src/java/org/apache/commons/cli/HelpFormatter.java?revision=779646&view=markup"
  },
